    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d6e",
      "text": "[カップ麺]作ってる時もカップ麺の向こうにいけばなが見えて本当に楽しい[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293616
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d6f",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/d6edecc158f8098518e0f59da8e08335]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293610
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d70",
      "text": "\t[BASE YAKISOBA 旨辛まぜそば]だ[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d71",
      "text": "\t　らーめんかも",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d72",
      "text": "\tいや！",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d73",
      "text": "　　[BASE RAMEN 醤油]かな[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d74",
      "text": "\t　そういえば旨辛まぜそば終売してるんだった[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d75",
      "text": "\t　\t好んで食べていた\t今思うとまあまあ…という感じではある",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d76",
      "text": "\t　\tでも新しい魚介醤油まぜそばが結構おいしいのでOKです",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d77",
      "text": "\tそう ！[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d78",
      "text": "\t待機3分の溢れる食欲が、麺のように湯気のようにカップから立ち上がっているのではなかろうか🤭[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78ad5c0000000000163d79",
      "text": "\t[ドラゴン柳]という漫画みたいな名前の枝らしい[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786293597,
      "updated": 1786293597
    },
